  "abstract": "Covers MITRE ATLAS, the knowledge base of adversary tactics and techniques against AI-enabled systems, at content release 2026.09 in ATLAS YAML format 6.0.0: the 16-tactic matrix, 120 techniques and 88 sub-techniques with maturity and platforms, 40 mitigations, 73 case studies, typed relationships, the link to MITRE ATT&CK, the agentic techniques, and the STIX, Navigator and Excel outputs. Version lines: content 2026.09 is current and content 2026.06 and 2021.10 are legacy (split at the bulk ID retirements of 2026.07 and the tactic renumbering of 2021.12); format 6.0.0 is current and the deprecated legacy YAML format is legacy, with upgrade steps for each. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions and upgrades, tactics and techniques, mitigations, the data format, and threat modeling, red teaming and detection mapping.",
